Comment:
 The binary /usr/bin/open-pointcloud-studio is built from the Rust workspace
 native/ of the source repository. Its desktop crate contains ribbon and
 properties-panel code adapted from a GPL-3.0 project that is credited in
 the source headers and in native/README.md; the notes of the release
 archives are in NOTICE.txt beside this file.
 .
 The binary /usr/lib/open-pointcloud-studio/OpenCADStudio is Open CAD Studio,
 https://github.com/HakanSeven12/OpenCADStudio, copyright Hakan Seven and the
 contributors of Open CAD Studio, licensed GPL-3. It is built without changes
 from one commit of that repository and is not part of the source repository
 of Open Pointcloud Studio; OpenCADStudio-NOTICE.txt beside this file names
 the commit and the file of the release page that holds its source. It links
 crates from git repositories, some of them under the MPL-2.0 and the
 LGPL-2.1-or-later; that notice names them, their repositories and commits,
 and the file of the release page that holds their source.

